  ⚠ Clone ssh://git.example.test/ops/stacks.git into    
    /srv/new-example?                                   
                                                        
  Only now the host key is stored and the changes listed
  below are made.                                       
    host: example.test                                  
    key type: ssh-ed25519                               
    fingerprint:                                        
    SHA256:ExampleFingerprintForTestsOnly0000000000     
    folder: /srv/new-example                            
                                                        
  Changes after yes                                     
    The folder is created with owner root:root and mode 
    0755.                                               
    The host key is stored and the repository is cloned 
    into the folder.                                    
    No permission changes: the service can write        
    already.                                            
    The folder is added to the systemd drop-in of the   
    service, which restarts once.                       
                                                        
    $ sudo qhost source add --url                       
      ssh://git.example.test/ops/stacks.git             
      --fingerprint                                     
      SHA256:ExampleFingerprintForTestsOnly0000000000   
      --expect-effect                                   
      sha256:example-effect-for-tests-only-0000000000000
      000000000000000 --yes --output json --            
      /srv/new-example                                  
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
